From 68bace36acfbc2564b056c53a0a9b3fe7410d99b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:56:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Settings > Update: install software updates online or from
 USB

A new Settings tab for ozark-update (meta-ozark): the radio's version
and build, the update address (an update feed, checked by hand or every
few hours), and installing a newer version from it or from a .swu file
on a USB drive. Installing shows its progress, then offers to restart
into the new version; the status says when an update is waiting, has
started, or didn't work and the radio went back.
